#ASSERT `o 30 r 5(2) the person informs the Tribunal in time` (JUST (Date 13 6 2026)) (Date 14 6 2026) (Date 20 6 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE -- O 30 r 5(2) 7 days: done before the last day
#ASSERT `o 30 r 5(2) the person informs the Tribunal in time` (JUST (Date 14 6 2026)) (Date 14 6 2026) (Date 20 6 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE -- O 30 r 5(2) 7 days: done on the last day (boundary)
#ASSERT `o 30 r 5(2) the person informs the Tribunal in time` (JUST (Date 15 6 2026)) (Date 14 6 2026) (Date 20 6 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE -- O 30 r 5(2) 7 days: done the day after the last day (boundary)
#ASSERT `o 30 r 5(2) the person informs the Tribunal in time` NOTHING (Date 14 6 2026) (Date 10 6 2026) EQUALS NOTHING -- O 30 r 5(2) 7 days: not yet done, period still running
#ASSERT `o 30 r 5(2) the person informs the Tribunal in time` NOTHING (Date 14 6 2026) (Date 15 6 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE -- O 30 r 5(2) 7 days: not done and the period has run out
